  "verified_topology": [
    "On each of AP441/451/461/471, the five A portions each carry an independent, pinless right-output wire to a separate left input of that slice’s five-input ✲OR portion. This includes the first two outputs on AP441: AW/07 and AX/08 are adjacent, distinct vertical rails. The accepted AP441 JSON AWAX merged edge is wrong.",
    "The ✲OR output joins the OR/DOT wired-OR junction, which has no printed card number. The same wired net branches to both 4191 N inputs of the slice, with the repeated D10/B04/G10/G03 label denoting a shared output/input pin.",
    "AP701 4191B1 has a pinless upper right output wired directly to 4191B2’s pinless left input. The printed G08 input/output annotations at B1 and J06 output at B2 should be retained independently.",
    "AP001 419103 and 419106 occur on K6; AP690 419135 and AP701 B1/B2 complete the 45-portion K6/K7 inventory."
  ],
