  "cautions": [
    "AP471 accepted JSON top-level source field is BF.J07@75, not a TIFF path; the actual native TIFF used here was selected by page name and separately hashed.",
    "AP441 accepted JSON merges AW and AX outputs as AWAX. The native source has independent rails; do not transfer that merged edge into the Card-ALD.",
    "AP001 and AP690 also show 4191 portions at neighboring K4; the inventory explicitly filters location K6.",
    "The user confirmed that OR/DOT joins the wires: each slice’s repeated pin label denotes a shared net that serves as both the ✲OR output and the two N inputs. The OR/DOT symbol is not card type 4633."
  ],
